~ start
Polyphemus: I know you only came here for a meal and a warm place for the night, little man, but it would hurt my heart to see you leave already. So please consider staying, maybe even just for a couple of days.
if ScoreManager.get_score_percentage() <= ScoreManager.BAD_ENDING_THRESHOLD
	#hostile Thoughts
	Nobody: (He fell not just for my trick, but for me it seems. If I stay just a bit longer I might be able to steal his flock for me and my men.)
	Nobody: I know what I have to do.
	- >Trick Polyphemus
		$> ScoreManager.score = 0
elif ScoreManager.get_score_percentage() >= ScoreManager.GOOD_ENDING_THRESHOLD
	#positive thoughts
	Nobody: (Never in my life have I felt as I have felt here on this island with Polyphemus and his sheep. I want to stay here with my big guy.. with my gentle giant.)
	Nobody: I know what I have to do.
	- >Stay with Polyphemus
		$> ScoreManager.score = 9999
else
	#neutral Thoughts
	Nobody: (I’m unsure what to do. On the one hand I could steal his flock and continue home with my men, but on the other hand he has been nothing but kind to me. I could just stay with him.)
	Nobody: What should I do?
	- >Stay with Polyphemus
		$> ScoreManager.score = 9999
	- >Trick Polyphemus
		$> ScoreManager.score = 0
=> END